<!DOCTYPE drumkv1>
<preset name="OrshortraStringsSlow" collection="Vee One Factory" autor="G3N-es" license="Creative Commons Zero (CC0) 1.0 Universal">
 <comments>
    An lo-fi instrument with a orchestral-cinematic character.
    The samples used were recorded directly combining in a shot several PadthV1 and SamplV1 Factory presets.
    (SamplV1 samples were created with SynthV1 Factory presets).

    You can customize each key using the offset and
    envelope settings to emulate different orchestral sections.

    For reference:

    "Default Ensemble"  Attack 0, Offset 0.
    "Winds"     Attack 0, Offset Start to X.
    "Staccato"  Attack 0, Offset X to end.

    Softening the attacks will yield slow winds or strings.
    Experiment and enjoy.
 </comments>
